<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Realkredit puts bond data on Internet.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Realkredit puts bond data on Internet.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Realkredit Danmark, Denmark's second-biggest mortgage lender, said on Tuesday that it had started placing information on its bonds on the Internet, in response to demand, particularly from foreign players.</p>
<p>&quot;By using the Internet, a broader circle of investors gets access to this data. By doing this RD is fulfilling the wishes of foreign investors especially,&quot; Realkredit said.</p>
<p>It said the service, on website http://www.re.dk carried details of the company's bonds and government paper as well as analysis.</p>
<p>--Ole Mikkelsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969654</p>
